BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sikinos-profitis-ilias-chapel-countryside-profitis-ilias-feast-sikin-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Profitis Ilias feast\, Sikinos chapel
LOCATION:Profitis Ilias chapel (countryside)\, Sikinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The municipality organises a proper panigiri at the hill chapel of Profitis Ilias on 20 July\, with musicians\, food and dancing for locals and visitors together — the mayor's own posts confirm it as an annual fixture. The chapel is reached on foot from the Chora–Episkopi road\; take water and a torch for the way down.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#profitis-ilias-chapel-countryside-profitis-ilias-feast-sikin
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#profitis-ilias-chapel-countryside-profitis-ilias-feast-sikin
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skyros-ai-lias-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-ai-lias-psili-and-trachy-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Ai-Lias (Psili and Trachy)
LOCATION:Ai-Lias\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Profitis Ilias is kept at two hilltop chapels\, Ai-Lias o Psilos on the night of 19-20 July and the Ai-Lias at Trachy on the 20th\, with the tavles of pilaf and goat after the service and music until dawn. Dirt-road access\; go with a local or a 4x4 and a torch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#ai-lias-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-ai-lias-psili-and-trachy
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#ai-lias-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-ai-lias-psili-and-trachy
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:syros-piskopio-episkopio-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-piskopio-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Piskopio
LOCATION:Piskopio (Episkopio)\, Syros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hill village of Piskopio above Ermoupoli celebrates Profitis Ilias on 19-20 July with vespers and a panigiri that opens the Syros summer: island food\, wine\, violin and laouto in the square. Easy to reach by taxi from town.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#piskopio-episkopio-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-piskopio
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#piskopio-episkopio-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-piskopio
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:evia-north-drymona-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-drymona-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270720
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Drymona
LOCATION:Drymona\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The mountain village of Drymona\, above the waterfall of the same name\, holds its Profitis Ilias panigiri in the schoolyard on 20 July with a live orchestra\, grilled meat and dancing\; it is in the municipal programme. Combine with a swim at the Drymona falls in the afternoon and drive carefully down the bends afterwards.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#drymona-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-drymona
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#drymona-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-drymona
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-vrakades-plastic-free-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-vrakades-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270720
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Plastic-free panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Vrakades
LOCATION:Vrakades\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Profitis Ilias always sits on a summit\, so these panigiria happen at hilltop chapels with the whole island spread out below and the dancing under the stars. Several villages celebrate the same night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#vrakades-plastic-free-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-vrakades
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#vrakades-plastic-free-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-vrakades
