BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lasithi-mesa-mouliana-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-mesa-mouliana-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270720
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Mesa Mouliana
LOCATION:Mesa Mouliana\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The wine village on the old Sitia–Agios Nikolaos road holds its Profitis Ilias feast on the evening of 20 July with several local lyra players and a token entry (5 euros in 2025) covering food and Mouliana wine. Part of the Kornaria programme of the Municipality of Sitia\; it starts at 9 pm and parking is along the main road.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#mesa-mouliana-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-mesa-mouliana
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#mesa-mouliana-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-mesa-mouliana
