BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kefalonia-atheras-paliki-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-atheras-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Atheras
LOCATION:Atheras (Paliki)\, Kefalonia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The northernmost village of the Paliki peninsula celebrates Agia Paraskevi on the night of the 26th itself\, from 9:30pm in the central square\, with the Angelos Andreatos orchestra\, 'abundant food\, wine and beer' in the municipality's own words\, and dancing. The beach of Atheras below is one of the calmest on the island\, so make a day of it.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#atheras-paliki-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-atheras
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kefalonia/#atheras-paliki-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-atheras
