BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lasithi-ziros-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-ziros-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Ziros
LOCATION:Ziros\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The largest village of the Sitia hinterland celebrates Agia Paraskevi on the evening of 26 July in the Heroes' Park with a full dinner (15 euros in 2025) and a Cretan kompania (the Chariakis brothers in 2025)\; Ziros repeats the formula on 29 August for its second panigiri. Half an hour from Sitia through the plateau\; tables go fast\, so arrive by 9 pm.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#ziros-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-ziros
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#ziros-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-ziros
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lefkada-alykes-karyoton-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-alykes-karyoto-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Alykes Karyoton
LOCATION:Alykes Karyoton\, Lefkada\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hamlet of Alykes Karyoton\, just above the lagoon on the way from town to Karya\, holds its panigiri for Agios Panteleimon on the evening of 26 July in the churchyard\, with a live orchestra\, grilled meat and wine from the local association. Small and friendly\, part of the municipal summer programme.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#alykes-karyoton-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-alykes-karyoto
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lefkada/#alykes-karyoton-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-alykes-karyoto
