BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leros-patelo-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-patelo-lakki-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Patelo (Lakki)
LOCATION:Patelo\, Leros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Agios Panteleimon feast on Leros is at Patelo\, above Lakki\, with a traditional glendi on the central square on the evening of the 26th: local orchestra\, free wine\, dancing. Organised with the municipality\, so it is well set up with tables.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/leros/#patelo-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-patelo-lakki
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/leros/#patelo-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-patelo-lakki
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:milos-korfos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-korfos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Korfos
LOCATION:Korfos\, Milos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hamlet of Korfos\, on the road to Emporios\, hosts one of the liveliest late-July feasts on Milos: vespers at 20:30 on 26 July followed by a full-band glenti (violin\, laouto\, keyboards\, drums) that runs into the small hours\, with liturgy at 08:00 next morning. Parking is on the roadside verges\; arrive before 21:00 or expect a walk.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#korfos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-korfos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#korfos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-korfos
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mykonos-marathi-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-marathi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Marathi
LOCATION:Marathi\, Mykonos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 26-27 July the chapels of Agios Panteleimon at Marathi\, Vorina and by the airport hold their family panigiria in the traditional way: vespers\, then food (lamb with lemon\, giachni\, meatballs) and wine for all comers and dancing to tsambouna. Marathi\, inland near Ano Mera\, is the easiest to find\; ask at Ano Mera which family is hosting.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/mykonos/#marathi-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-marathi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/mykonos/#marathi-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-marathi
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paros-prodromos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kostos-and-prodromos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Kostos and Prodromos
LOCATION:Prodromos\, Paros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Both Kostos and Prodromos have a chapel of Agios Panteleimon and hold a village feast for the saint on the evening of 26 July\, with food and island music. The municipal tourism page lists this feast under two wrong dates (26 June and 26 August)\, so treat 26-27 July as the correct one and confirm locally. Prodromos is the easier of the two to reach and has the bigger square.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#prodromos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kostos-and-prodromos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paros/#prodromos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kostos-and-prodromos
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:patmos-chiliomodi-islet-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chiliomodi-is-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Chiliomodi islet
LOCATION:Chiliomodi islet\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 26 July caiques ferry people from Skala across to the uninhabited islet of Chiliomodi for the vespers at Agios Panteleimon\, then food\, wine and singing on the shore into the night. Ask at the Skala harbour that afternoon which boats are going and take a jumper.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#chiliomodi-islet-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chiliomodi-is
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#chiliomodi-islet-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chiliomodi-is
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:samos-kokkari-two-night-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kokkari-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Two-night panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Kokkari
LOCATION:Kokkari\, Samos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kokkari's summer festival on 26 and 27 July\, run by the 'Aristarchos' association with the local council: two live orchestras on successive nights (from 20:30 at the central car park by the harbour)\, local dance groups\, free entry\, food and drink from stalls. The seaside village also holds a smaller Agios Fanourios panigiri on 26 August. Stay in Kokkari or take the last bus back to Vathy.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#kokkari-two-night-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kokkari
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#kokkari-two-night-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kokkari
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:samothrace-palaiopoli-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-palaiopoli-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Palaiopoli
LOCATION:Palaiopoli\, Samothrace\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Held at Palaiopoli next to the Sanctuary of the Great Gods\, on 26 July\, organised by the 'Saos' cultural association: liturgy\, then food and dancing in the shadow of the archaeological site. Palaiopoli also keeps Sts Peter and Paul (29 June) with a vespers and all-night vigil at Alevantza.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samothrace/#palaiopoli-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-palaiopoli
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samothrace/#palaiopoli-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-palaiopoli
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sifnos-cheronissos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-cheronissos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Cheronissos
LOCATION:Cheronissos\, Sifnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fishing hamlet at the island's northern tip celebrates Agios Panteleimon on the evening of 26 July at the beachside church of Agios Polykarpos\, with chickpea soup and lamb at tables by the water and a takimi playing into the night\; a second\, smaller feast is held the same night at Agios Charalambos on the road in. The road from Artemonas is long and winding — go early\, eat at the taverna\, and don't plan on driving back fast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sifnos/#cheronissos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-cheronissos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sifnos/#cheronissos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-cheronissos
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sikinos-chora-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Sikinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Sikinos's main summer panigiri\, for Agios Panteleimon: service at the chapel\, then dinner\, wine\, live music and dancing in which the whole village and its visitors join — in 2026 it was held at Pantanassa and the main square of Chora and ran on 29 July for practical reasons\, so the exact night can shift by a day or two\; check sikinos.gr. The island's few rooms fill in late July — book.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/sikinos/#chora-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chora
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skyros-molos-panigiri-of-agios-ermolaos-molos-boat-procession-to-th-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Ermolaos\, Molos (boat procession to the islet)
LOCATION:Molos\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The most photogenic Skyrian feast: on 26 July fishing boats ferry everyone from Molos beach to the islet of Agios Ermolaos opposite for the liturgy in the chapel\, and then the party moves back to the square at Molos with dancing\, singing and plates of seafood. The municipality lists it among the island's traditional panigiria\; greeka gives the 25th\, so check locally. Boats fill fast\, so be on the beach early in the morning.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#molos-panigiri-of-agios-ermolaos-molos-boat-procession-to-th
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#molos-panigiri-of-agios-ermolaos-molos-boat-procession-to-th
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:skyros-trachy-marmaro-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-trachy-and-marm-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Trachy and Marmaro
LOCATION:Trachy / Marmaro\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Two chapels of Agios Panteleimon keep the feast on 26-27 July\, at Trachy on the road to the airport and at Marmaro in the north. Skyrian panigiria follow the same script: vespers\, then the tavles\, long tables where pilaf and roast goat or lamb are served to all comers\, and violin-and-lute music until morning. Both are reachable only by car\; bring a jumper\, the north of the island is windy at night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#trachy-marmaro-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-trachy-and-marm
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#trachy-marmaro-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-trachy-and-marm
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:symi-nanou-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-nanou-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Nanou
LOCATION:Nanou\, Symi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The little monastery above Nanou beach on the east coast has its feast on 26-27 July with a vespers and a glendi with fish\, wine and song. Nanou is reached by boat from Gialos or a long walk\; the taxi boats run late on the feast night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nanou-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-nanou
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/symi/#nanou-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-nanou
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:syros-finikas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-finikas-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Finikas
LOCATION:Finikas\, Syros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The parish church of Finikas on the south-west coast celebrates Agios Panteleimon on 26-27 July with vespers and a seaside panigiri: food from the association\, wine and island music by the marina. The Catholic chapel of the same saint at Papouri in Apano Meria keeps a smaller feast the same evening.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#finikas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-finikas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#finikas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-finikas
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tilos-agios-panteleimon-monastery-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-mo-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270729
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon (monastery)
LOCATION:Agios Panteleimon monastery\, Tilos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's biggest panigiri — three days at the fortified Agios Panteleimon monastery on the green slopes of Profitis Ilias. Pilgrims come from across the Dodecanese for the liturgy to the island's patron\, the healer saint\, and the celebration runs on live music\, dancing and free food and wine deep into the night. The monastery is about 8km from Megalo Chorio.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#agios-panteleimon-monastery-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-mo
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#agios-panteleimon-monastery-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-mo
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lemnos-tsimandria-panigiri-of-agia-irini-chrysovalantou-tsimandria-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270727
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270729
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Irini Chrysovalantou\, Tsimandria
LOCATION:Tsimandria\, Lemnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 'Kechagiades' association of Tsimandria\, in the flat farming centre of the island\, throws its panigiri on the evening of 27 July (eve of Agia Irini Chrysovalantou) on the village five-a-side pitch: live Lemnian band\, the association's dance groups\, souvlaki\, loukoumades and drinks\, a raffle\, 5 euro entry. Sponsored by the municipality. Tsimandria's 'Enniamera' feast on 23 August was cancelled in 2026\, so do not count on that one.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#tsimandria-panigiri-of-agia-irini-chrysovalantou-tsimandria
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#tsimandria-panigiri-of-agia-irini-chrysovalantou-tsimandria
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lesvos-perama-agios-panteleimon-and-the-greased-pole-stylos-perama-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270727
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Agios Panteleimon and the greased-pole 'Stylos'\, Perama
LOCATION:Perama\, Lesvos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:In the old olive-oil port of Perama on the Gulf of Gera\, Agios Panteleimon (27 July) is celebrated with the 'Stylos': a greased log is fixed over the water on the pier with a flag at the end\, and young men try to walk out and grab it while the crowd cheers from the quay. Feast and music follow. Agios Panteleimon is also kept the same weekend at Skala Eresou (Portos)\, Apothika\, Megali Tsichranta and Plomari.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lesvos/#perama-agios-panteleimon-and-the-greased-pole-stylos-perama
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lesvos/#perama-agios-panteleimon-and-the-greased-pole-stylos-perama
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tilos-megalo-chorio-koupa-dance-taxiarchis-megalo-chorio-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270728
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270729
SUMMARY:Koupa dance\, Taxiarchis\, Megalo Chorio
LOCATION:Megalo Chorio\, Tilos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The day after the monastery feast\, on 28 July\, the villagers of Megalo Chorio dance the 'koupa' in the courtyard of the Taxiarchis church: the old Tilos custom where the lead dancer holds a cup and the roles of the feast pass from one household to the next for the coming year. Come in the evening\; it is followed by food and music.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#megalo-chorio-koupa-dance-taxiarchis-megalo-chorio
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#megalo-chorio-koupa-dance-taxiarchis-megalo-chorio
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rhodes-soroni-panigiri-of-agios-soulas-silas-soroni-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270729
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270801
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Soulas (Silas)\, Soroni
LOCATION:Soroni\, Rhodes\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The biggest country fair on Rhodes: a two-week run of events in the pine woods around the Agios Soulas hermitage above Soroni\, peaking on 28-30 July with donkey and horse races on the little hippodrome\, a contest for the best traditional reed hut (kalyva)\, souvlaki stalls and dancing to local bands. People come from every village on the island\, so arrive before sunset on the 29th to park anywhere near the site.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#soroni-panigiri-of-agios-soulas-silas-soroni
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rhodes/#soroni-panigiri-of-agios-soulas-silas-soroni
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:psara-psara-night-procession-of-the-panagia-icon-from-the-monaster-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270801
SUMMARY:Night procession of the Panagia icon from the monastery
LOCATION:Psara\, Psara\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:At midnight on 31 July the young people of Psara walk three hours up to the monastery of the Dormition in the north of the island and carry the icon back down to the village at dawn\, where it stays until the feast. A moving\, entirely local custom\; join the walk with a torch and good shoes\, or wait at the harbour for the arrival.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/psara/#psara-night-procession-of-the-panagia-icon-from-the-monaster
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/psara/#psara-night-procession-of-the-panagia-icon-from-the-monaster
END:VEVENT
